-empty" data-module-id="69b03231d5d2ddc996460f26" data-module-key="main-block-0" data-item-position="2"><article class="prose w-full max-w-4xl rounded-md bg-white"><div data-testid="article-header"><div class="align-center flex items-center justify-between pb-4" data-testid="article-header-top-row"><div data-testid="article-category-container"><p class="text-sm leading-loose tracking-tight text-gray-900 m-0 font-bold flatplan_category" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_category" data-testid="article-category-text">news/weather</p></div></div><h1 class="tracking-tight text-gray-900 flatplan_header m-0 py-2 text-3xl leading-[1.1] font-extrabold lg:text-4xl" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_header" data-testid="article-headline">Rain Delays Qualifying For The Indy 500</h1><h2 class="text-lg leading-loose tracking-normal text-gray-900 flatplan_intro m-0 py-2 font-medium" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_intro" data-testid="article-subheadline">Qualifying for the Indianapolis 500 was rained out Saturday and was pushed back to Sunday.</h2><div class="flex items-center pt-2 pb-4" data-testid="authors-container"><div class="inline" data-testid="author-text-container"><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-900 mr-1 inline leading-[1rem]" data-testid="by-text">By</span><a href="https://weather.com/bios/mark-smith" data-testid="author-link-0"><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-900 flatplan_authorName inline leading-[1rem] underline" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_authorName" data-testid="author-name-linked-0">Mark Smith</span></a><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-500 mx-1 inline leading-[1rem]" data-testid="date-separator">•</span><details class="inline" data-testid="update-date-details"><summary class="inline cursor-pointer list-none" data-testid="update-date-toggle"><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-500 inline leading-[1rem] whitespace-nowrap" data-testid="update-date">May 17, 2026</span></summary><span class="block" data-testid="date-expanded"><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-500 block leading-[1rem]" data-testid="update-date-full">Updated: May 17, 2026, 9:23 am EDT</span><span class="text-sm tracking-tight font-medium text-gray-500 block leading-[1rem]" data-testid="publish-date-full">Published: May 16, 2026, 10:19 am EDT</span></span></details></div></div><div class="mt-2 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2"><button class="cursor-pointer items-center px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-500 rounded-lg border border-[#676767] bg-transparent flex" data-testid="view-comments-button"><div class="flex items-center gap-1" data-testid="view-comments-button-content"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="inline-block w-4 h-4 text-gray-900 m-0" data-testid="comments-icon"><title>Description</title><g fill="currentColor"><!-- -2 children --></g></svg><p class="text-sm leading-loose tracking-tight text-brand-dark m-0 font-bold" data-testid="comments-text">Start the conversation</p></div></button><div class="flex items-center justify-between" data-testid="share-container"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="radix-_r_1_" data-state="closed" data-slot="popover-trigger"><div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center text-sm text-gray-500 px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-[#676767] bg-transparent" data-testid="share-button"><div class="align-center flex items-center" data-testid="share-button-content"><!-- -2 children --></div></div></button></div></div></div><div class="flatplan_body" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_body"><div><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><img alt="109th Running Of The Indianapolis 500" data-flatplan-id="flatplan_mainMedia" loading="lazy" width="320" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shadow-md rounded-lg object-contain h-auto w-full flatplan_mainMedia" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/indy-500-051626?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60"><figcaption class="mt-2 text-sm leading-tight"><p>INDIANAPOLIS, INDIANA - MAY 25: Jack Harvey, driver of the #24 DRR Cusick Invst Chevrolet, leads a pack of cars during the NTT IndyCar Series109th Running Of The Indianapolis 500 at Indianapolis Motor Speedway on May 25, 2025 in Indianapolis, Indiana. (Photo by James Gilbert/Getty Images)</p><p class="m-0 text-gray-500">(Getty Images)</p></figcaption></figure><p><br></p><p>The first round of qualifying for the 110th Indianapolis 500 was rained out Saturday, leading to a busy, condensed schedule on Sunday.</p><p>Storms and showers rained out practice on Saturday morning and kept coming into the afternoon, forcing IndyCar to push all qualifying to Sunday.</p><div class="flex items-center">
        <div class="twitter-tweet twitter-tweet-rendered" style="display: flex; max-width: 550px; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><iframe id="twitter-widget-0" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowtransparency="true" allowfullscreen="true" title="X Post" src="cid:frame-0AE20578FECC7B6A8B7E72EEF30BED0A@mhtml.blink" style="position: static; visibility: visible; width: 550px; height: 873px; display: block; flex-grow: 1;" data-tweet-id="2055735182292828440"></iframe></div>
      </div><p><br></p><p>Qualifying will begin at noon on Sunday, and each driver will only get one try at qualifying for the Fast 12 and a second qualifying session. More on this procedure can be found <a href="https://www.indycar.com/-/media/Files/2026/NICS/07-500/indycar-QualDraw-Sat-26I500.pdf" rel="external nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>. </p><p>Fortunately for IndyCar, Sunday's activities at Indianapolis Motor Speedway won't be rained out. Forecasters are calling for a dry, warm and mostly sunny day on Sunday.</p><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><img alt="Indianapolis forecast" loading="lazy" width="320" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shadow-md rounded-lg object-contain h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60"></figure><p>The green flag will drop on the iconic race at 12:45 p.m. on May 24.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6" id="comments-section"><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-6 min-h-[60px]"><div data-spotim-app="reactions" data-post-id="6a088b41517d55b0c192b669" data-theme="TWC Buddies" class="min-h-[60px]"><ow-inijsc75sp8><template shadowmode="open"><!-- -1 children --></template></ow-inijsc75sp8></div><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 cursor-pointer bg-transparent" aria-label="Sign in to react to this content"></div></div><div class="relative"><div id="openweb-comments" data-spotim-module="conversation" data-post-id="6a088b41517d55b0c192b669" data-post-url="https://weather.com/2026/05/16/news/weather/rain-delays-qualifying-for-the-indy-500" data-article-tags="weather,news" class="min-h-[200px]" data-module-element-id="5883bab5a674f7fb618ce100cb40564c"><ow-inijsc75sp8><template shadowmode="open"><!-- -1 children --></template></ow-inijsc75sp8></div><div class="absolute inset-0 z-10 cursor-pointer bg-transparent" aria-label="Sign in to comment"></div></div></div></div></article></di