        <div class="twitter-tweet twitter-tweet-rendered" style="display: flex; max-width: 550px; width: 100%; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;"><iframe id="twitter-widget-0" scrolling="no" frameborder="0" allowtransparency="true" allowfullscreen="true" title="X Post" src="cid:frame-0AE20578FECC7B6A8B7E72EEF30BED0A@mhtml.blink" style="position: static; visibility: visible; width: 550px; height: 873px; display: block; flex-grow: 1;" data-tweet-id="2055735182292828440"></iframe></div>
      </div><p><br></p><p>Qualifying will begin at noon on Sunday, and each driver will only get one try at qualifying for the Fast 12 and a second qualifying session. More on this procedure can be found <a href="https://www.indycar.com/-/media/Files/2026/NICS/07-500/indycar-QualDraw-Sat-26I500.pdf" rel="external nofollow" target="_blank">here</a>. </p><p>Fortunately for IndyCar, Sunday's activities at Indianapolis Motor Speedway won't be rained out. Forecasters are calling for a dry, warm and mostly sunny day on Sunday.</p><figure class="my-4 flex flex-col"><img alt="Indianapolis forecast" loading="lazy" width="320" height="180" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="shadow-md rounded-lg object-contain h-auto w-full" style="color:transparent" src="https://s.w-x.co/wxnext/img/0517_INdy_Snap-f2f40c.png?format=auto&optimize=medium&width=1600&quality=60"></figure><p>The green flag will drop on the iconic race at 12:45 p.m. on May 24.</p></div></div><div class="mt-8 border-t border-gray-200 pt-6" id="comments-section"><div class="relative"><div class="relative mb-6 min-h-[60px]"><div data-spotim-app="reactions" data-post-id="6a088b41517d55b0c192b669" data-theme="TWC Buddies" class="min-h-[60px]"><ow-inijsc75sp8><template shadowmode="open"><div shell-wrapper=""><div data-spotim-app="reactions" data-post-id="6a088b41517d55b0c192b669" data-theme="TWC Buddies" class="min-h-[60px]" shell-ad-wrapper="" ignore-host="" style="width: 100%;"><svg style="display: none;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"><defs><symbol viewBox="0 0 384 512" id="arrow-up"><path d="M214.6 41.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-12.5 32.8 0 45.3s32.8 12.5 45.3 0L160 141.2V448c0 17.7 14.3 32 32 32s32-14.3 32-32V141.2l105.4 105.4c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0s12.5-32.8 0-45.3l-160-160z" /></symbol><symbol viewBox="0 0 16 16" id="arrows-repeat"><path d="M16 7.984c0-.817-.219-1.633-.563-2.351-.218-.457-.812-.555-1.187-.196l-.375.424a.775.775 0 0 0-.